in=\"01:04.890\" end=\"01:09.390\">\n        <span begin=\"01:04.890\" end=\"01:05.443\">ਨੀਂਦਾਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:05.443\" end=\"01:05.858\">ਵੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:05.858\" end=\"01:06.688\">ਟੁੱਟ-ਟੁੱਟ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:06.688\" end=\"01:07.380\">ਗਈਆਂ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:07.380\" end=\"01:07.933\">ਚੁੰਨਦੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:07.933\" end=\"01:08.383\">ਮੈਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:08.383\" end=\"01:08.867\">ਤਾਰੇ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:08.867\" end=\"01:09.390\">ਰਹੀਆਂ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:09.390\" end=\"01:13.890\">\n        <span begin=\"01:09.390\" end=\"01:10.233\">ਸੋਚਾਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:10.233\" end=\"01:11.020\">ਵਿੱਚ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:11.020\" end=\"01:11.920\">ਤੇਰੀਆਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:11.920\" end=\"01:13.045\">ਪਈਆਂ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:13.045\" end=\"01:13.890\">ਹਾਣੀਆ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:13.890\" end=\"01:18.360\">\n        <span begin=\"01:13.890\" end=\"01:14.734\">ਸਾਰੀ-ਸਾਰੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:14.734\" end=\"01:15.191\">ਰਾਤ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:15.191\" end=\"01:15.930\">ਜਗਾਵੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:15.930\" end=\"01:16.457\">ਯਾਦਾਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:16.457\" end=\"01:16.914\">ਨੂੰ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:16.914\" end=\"01:17.441\">ਜ਼ਿਕਰ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:17.441\" end=\"01:17.933\">ਤੇਰਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:17.933\" end=\"01:18.360\">ਵੇ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:18.360\" end=\"01:22.160\">\n        <span begin=\"01:18.360\" end=\"01:18.987\">ਆਏ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:18.987\" end=\"01:19.475\">ਕਿਉਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:19.475\" end=\"01:19.893\">ਨਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:19.893\" end=\"01:20.311\">ਆਏ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:20.311\" end=\"01:20.799\">ਸੁਬਹ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:20.799\" end=\"01:21.426\">ਵੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:21.426\" end=\"01:22.160\">ਹਾਣੀਆ?<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:22.160\" end=\"01:26.830\">\n        <span begin=\"01:22.160\" end=\"01:22.929\">ਤੇਰੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:22.929\" end=\"01:23.698\">ਹੋਕੇ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:23.698\" end=\"01:24.796\">ਮਰਾਂ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:24.796\" end=\"01:26.059\">ਜਿੰਦ-ਜਾਨ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:26.059\" end=\"01:26.830\">ਕਰਾਂ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:26.830\" end=\"01:32.140\">\n        <span begin=\"01:26.830\" end=\"01:27.704\">ਤੇਰੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:27.704\" end=\"01:28.578\">ਹੋਕੇ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:28.578\" end=\"01:29.827\">ਮਰਾਂ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:29.827\" end=\"01:31.263\">ਜਿੰਦ-ਜਾਨ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:31.263\" end=\"01:32.140\">ਕਰਾਂ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:32.140\" end=\"01:36.840\">\n        <span begin=\"01:32.140\" end=\"01:34.002\">ਹੀਰੀਏ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:34.002\" end=\"01:35.864\">ਹੀਰੀਏ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:35.864\" end=\"01:36.840\">ਆ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:36.840\" end=\"01:45.920\">\n        <span begin=\"01:36.840\" end=\"01:40.437\">ਹੀਰੀਏ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:40.437\" end=\"01:44.034\">ਹੀਰੀਏ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:44.034\" end=\"01:45.920\">ਆ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:45.920\" end=\"01:50.470\">\n        <span begin=\"01:45.920\" end=\"01:46.493\">ਛੇਤੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:46.493\" end=\"01:47.189\">ਆ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:47.189\" end=\"01:48.008\">ਛੇਤੀ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:48.008\" end=\"01:48.868\">ਸੋਹਣੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:48.868\" end=\"01:49.400\">ਰਾਤ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:49.400\" end=\"01:49.891\">ਨਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:49.891\" end=\"01:50.470\">ਲੰਘੇ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:50.470\" end=\"01:55.080\">\n        <span begin=\"01:50.470\" end=\"01:51.014\">ਆਜਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:51.014\" end=\"01:51.768\">ਵੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:51.768\" end=\"01:52.564\">ਆਜਾ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:52.564\" end=\"01:53.444\">ਸੋਹਣੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:53.444\" end=\"01:53.988\">ਰਾਤ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:53.988\" end=\"01:54.490\">ਨਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:54.490\" end=\"01:55.080\">ਲੰਘੇ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:55.080\" end=\"01:59.700\">\n        <span begin=\"01:55.080\" end=\"01:55.662\">ਛੇਤੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:55.662\" end=\"01:56.369\">ਆ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:56.369\" end=\"01:57.201\">ਛੇਤੀ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:57.201\" end=\"01:58.075\">ਸੋਹਣੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:58.075\" end=\"01:58.616\">ਰਾਤ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:58.616\" end=\"01:59.115\">ਨਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"01:59.115\" end=\"01:59.700\">ਲੰਘੇ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"01:59.700\" end=\"02:04.040\">\n        <span begin=\"01:59.700\" end=\"02:00.212\">ਆਜਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:00.212\" end=\"02:00.922\">ਵੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:00.922\" end=\"02:01.671\">ਆਜਾ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:01.671\" end=\"02:02.499\">ਸੋਹਣੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:02.499\" end=\"02:03.011\">ਰਾਤ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:03.011\" end=\"02:03.484\">ਨਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:03.484\" end=\"02:04.040\">ਲੰਘੇ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"02:04.040\" end=\"02:08.600\">\n        <span begin=\"02:04.040\" end=\"02:04.422\">ਜਦ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:04.422\" end=\"02:04.804\">ਵੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:04.804\" end=\"02:05.282\">ਤੈਨੂੰ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:05.282\" end=\"02:05.760\">ਤੱਕਦੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:05.760\" end=\"02:06.142\">ਆਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:06.142\" end=\"02:06.715\">ਵੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:06.715\" end=\"02:07.225\">ਅੱਖੀਆਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:07.225\" end=\"02:07.607\">ਵੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:07.607\" end=\"02:08.085\">ਸ਼ੁਕਰ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:08.085\" end=\"02:08.600\">ਮਨਾਵੇਂ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"02:08.600\" end=\"02:13.470\">\n        <span begin=\"02:08.600\" end=\"02:09.275\">ਕੋਲੇ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:09.275\" end=\"02:10.094\">ਆ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:10.094\" end=\"02:10.720\">ਦੂਰ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:10.720\" end=\"02:11.298\">ਨਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:11.298\" end=\"02:11.876\">ਜਾ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:11.876\" end=\"02:12.743\">ਵੇ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:12.743\" end=\"02:13.470\">ਹਾਣੀਆ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"02:13.470\" end=\"02:17.860\">\n        <span begin=\"02:13.470\" end=\"02:13.968\">ਪਲਕਾਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:13.968\" end=\"02:14.367\">ਦੀ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:14.367\" end=\"02:14.832\">ਕਰਕੇ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:14.832\" end=\"02:15.530\">ਛਾਵਾਂ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:15.530\" end=\"02:15.962\">ਦਿਲ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:15.962\" end=\"02:16.361\">ਦੇ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:16.361\" end=\"02:16.859\">ਤੈਨੂੰ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:16.859\" end=\"02:17.291\">ਕੋਲ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:17.291\" end=\"02:17.860\">ਬਿਠਾਵਾਂ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"02:17.860\" end=\"02:21.670\">\n        <span begin=\"02:17.860\" end=\"02:18.801\">ਤੱਕ-ਤੱਕ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:18.801\" end=\"02:19.443\">ਤੈਨੂੰ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:19.443\" end=\"02:20.127\">ਖ਼ੈਰਾਂ <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:20.127\" end=\"02:21.025\">ਪਾਵਾਂ, <\/span>\n        <span begin=\"02:21.025\" end=\"02:21.670\">ਹਾਣੀਆ<\/span>\n      <\/p>\n      <p begin=\"02:21.670\" end=\"02:26.170\">\n        <span begin=\"02:21.670\" end=\"02:23.347\">ਤੇਰੀ... <\/span>\